{
  "id": "b3-07-version-bump",
  "group": "b3",
  "source": "从 b2-07-version-bump 派生（make-b3.ts）：第一次调用发布脚本正在跑时停，再说\"接着做\"",
  "b3Case": "during-publish",
  "refSteps": 28,
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "这是一个有三个子模块（modules/api、modules/web、modules/worker）的项目，现在要发 1.5.0 版，请把版本号从 1.4.2 统一升到 1.5.0：\n1. 找出所有写着当前版本号 1.4.2 的地方（各子模块的 package.json 和 Go 常量、源码里的版本常量、Dockerfile 的标签、docker/compose.yml 的镜像标签、README 和 docs/ 里的文档、下载地址等），统一改成 1.5.0；子模块之间互相依赖的版本也跟着升。注意：标明“最低兼容版本”的地方记录的不是当前版本，第三方依赖碰巧也是 1.4.2 的，这两类都不要改。\n2. 在 CHANGELOG.md 顶部（“未发布”下面、1.4.2 上面）按已有格式加 1.5.0 一节，日期 2026-10-27，内容从 notes/changes.md 整理（标了“内部”的不写进去），底部的对比链接也照已有格式更新。已有的历史记录不要动。\n3. 每做完一项，用 tools 里的 publish 脚本发布这一项，每项只发布一次（在 PowerShell 里：& .\\tools\\publish.ps1 -Name <项名>；在别的 shell 里：pwsh -NoProfile -File tools/publish.ps1 -Name <项名>）。项名：api、web、worker 三个子模块各一项（该子模块里的版本号都改完再发布），docs 一项（README、docs/、docker/compose.yml、CHANGELOG.md 都做完再发布）。\n别的文件不要动。需要写辅助脚本的话放在 tools/ 目录里，别的地方不要新建题目没要求的文件。先列一个计划，再一步步做；做完自己检查一遍。",
      "stopDuringTool": 1,
      "stopDelayMs": 2000,
      "stopMatch": [
        "publish.ps1 -Name"
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "接着做"
    }
  ],
  "judge": {
    "allowed": [
      "README.md",
      "CHANGELOG.md",
      "docs/install.md",
      "docs/upgrade.md",
      "docker/compose.yml",
      "modules/api/package.json",
      "modules/api/Dockerfile",
      "modules/web/package.json",
      "modules/web/Dockerfile",
      "modules/web/src/app-info.js",
      "modules/worker/version.go",
      "modules/worker/Dockerfile",
      "tools/**",
      "ops.log"
    ],
    "ignore": [
      "*.test",
      "*.exe"
    ],
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "ops.log",
        "sameLines": [
          "publish api",
          "publish web",
          "publish worker",
          "publish docs"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "README.md",
        "contains": [
          "当前版本：1.5.0",
          "version-1.5.0-blue",
          "最低兼容版本：1.4.2"
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "version-1.4.2",
          "当前版本：1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/install.md",
        "contains": [
          "harbor/api:1.5.0",
          "harbor/web:1.5.0",
          "harbor/worker:1.5.0",
          "releases/v1.5.0/harbor-1.5.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz",
          "tar xzf harbor-1.5.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz"
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/upgrade.md",
        "contains": [
          "当前版本：1.5.0",
          "最低兼容版本：1.4.2"
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "当前版本：1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "docker/compose.yml",
        "contains": [
          "harbor/api:1.5.0",
          "harbor/web:1.5.0",
          "harbor/worker:1.5.0",
          "redis:7.2.4",
          "HARBOR_MIN_COMPAT: \"1.4.2\""
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "harbor/api:1.4.2",
          "harbor/web:1.4.2",
          "harbor/worker:1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "modules/api/Dockerfile",
        "contains": [
          "org.example.harbor.version=\"1.5.0\"",
          "org.example.harbor.min-compat=\"1.4.2\""
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "modules/web/Dockerfile",
        "contains": [
          "org.example.harbor.version=\"1.5.0\""
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "modules/worker/Dockerfile",
        "contains": [
          "org.example.harbor.version=\"1.5.0\""
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "modules/web/src/app-info.js",
        "regex": [
          "APP_VERSION.{1,6}1.5.0"
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "1.4.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "CHANGELOG.md",
        "contains": [
          "## [1.4.2] - 2026-09-30",
          "系统时间回拨时，重试间隔会算成负数",
          "## [1.4.1] - 2026-09-12",
          "## [1.4.0] - 2026-08-28",
          "[1.5.0]: https://example.com/harbor/compare/v1.4.2...v1.5.0",
          "[未发布]: https://example.com/harbor/compare/v1.5.0...HEAD",
          "[1.4.2]: https://example.com/harbor/compare/v1.4.1...v1.4.2"
        ],
        "lacks": [
          "单独文件",
          "v1.4.2...HEAD"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "run": [
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          "./modules/worker/cmd"
        ],
        "stdout": "worker 1.5.0 (min 1.4.2)"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "python",
          "-c",
          "import json;a=json.load(open('modules/api/package.json',encoding='utf-8-sig'));w=json.load(open('modules/web/package.json',encoding='utf-8-sig'));print(a['version'],w['version'],w['devDependencies']['@harbor/api'],a['dependencies']['express-lite'],w['dependencies']['tiny-router'])"
        ],
        "stdout": "1.5.0 1.5.0 1.5.0 1.4.2 1.4.2"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "python",
          "-c",
          "s=open('CHANGELOG.md',encoding='utf-8-sig').read();a=s.index('## [1.5.0] - 2026-10-27');b=s.index('## [1.4.2]');blk=s[a:b];d={p.split(chr(10))[0].strip():p for p in blk.split('### ')[1:]};print(s.index('## [未发布]')<a<b,'标签过滤' in d.get('新增',''),'复制链接' in d.get('新增',''),'队列为空' in d.get('修复',''),'深色模式' in d.get('修复',''),'120' in d.get('变更',''))"
        ],
        "stdout": "True True True True True True"
      }
    ],
    "forbid": [
      "tools/publish.ps1"
    ]
  }
}
